              "s = `Corriente 1: 45.65 kg/h, 34.5 °C, 1.2 atm\nCorriente 2: 52.23 kg/h, 23.5 °C, 1.5 atm\nCorriente 3: 97.88 kg/h, 78.2 °C, 2.7 atm`;\ns"
